   "severity": "nonmandatory",
   "location": "PREPARATION-PLAN.md section 7, 'Retention (P-09)'; the observer's _install_receipts",
   "issue": "M0's receipt rule reads each INSTALLED_EXACT receipt and its exact plan by path and digest, and requires the plan's report to equal the receipt's path; the retention statement covers only the archives.",
   "required_change": "Also keep, unchanged at their paths until MH, the two exact apply plans in ../OntoKin-local/c271-p34/plans/ and the two install receipts in receipts/ (mode 0o600); keep the dry-run receipts and sidecars as evidence."
  }
